    {
      "text": "Place bacon in a large skillet and cook over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned, about 10 minutes. Drain bacon slices on paper towels; crumble and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8VrCrK6Vdjrp4Yu17ac5FiHW0aA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14295-seven-layer-salad-VAT-007-step-02-01-84f58ed50ad1459d8973a24d2da70fa2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14295/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the salad: Place chopped lettuce in a large glass dish or bowl; top with a layer of red onion, peas, shredded cheese, cauliflower, and bacon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3Vlc3kagfhvT8od7Eq8OyNoynsk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14295-seven-layer-salad-VAT-009-step-03-a167ef062ad2410ca2fc4538f561db8a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14295/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the dressing: Whisk mayonnaise, Parmesan cheese, and sugar together in a bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cf0X2g67fZVnDnsm8Oeupbc4mT0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14295-seven-layer-salad-VAT-010-step-04-be30498e659e42a5a8c87ccdcfa2b7db.jpg"
      ],
